:""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!rwakEnTUPpQ653sg.ZGT5tuxpKDfepkTr"},{"_id":"Eu72dpTXiYJQD7Hm","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Web Tether","sort":800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A creature hit by the spider's web Strike is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} and tethered to the spider, preventing it from moving farther away from the spider.</p>\n<p>The spider can have one creature tethered at a time. The DC to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SjmKHgI7a5Z9JzBx]{Force Open} the web is 30. The tether can be severed with a Strike (AC 20, Hardness 5, HP 20), but this doesn't free the restrained creature.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"web-tether","traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!rwakEnTUPpQ653sg.Eu72dpTXiYJQD7Hm"}],"name":"Shadowpact Goliath Spider","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":-4},"con":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":-5},"str":{"mod":8},"wis":{"mod":3}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":30},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":220,"temp":0,"value":220},"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"climb","value":30}],"value":45}},"details":{"blurb":"Variant goliath spider","languages":{"details":"","value":[]},"level":{"value":11},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Goliath spiders dwell in the deepest jungles, where they build webs as big as temples and f